\title{refPanelTools: Tools for Reference Panel Datasets}
\description{
Provides tools for indexing, extracting, and simulating data from BGZF-compressed whole-genome sequencing reference panel datasets such as the 33KG panel. Functions support extraction by chromosome, population subset, or genomic region, as well as simulation of association Z-scores under the null for multi-ethnic GWAS.
}
\details{
The package indexes BGZF-compressed reference panels, extracts genotype data
by chromosome, genomic region or population subset, and simulates allele
frequencies and association Z-scores under the null for multi-ethnic GWAS.
